# PyCharm
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate file from Python
#  regularly, and can be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For now, we include the most common excludes.
.idea/

